# Cloudflare Pages reads this file and adds these headers to every response.
# They harden a static page that has no need to be framed, sniffed or to use
# device features. (HSTS is left to the Cloudflare zone setting on purpose: a
# header here that covered subdomains could also affect app.loomaudit.com.)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
